  "summary": [
    "Pre-search check distinguishes no rebuild needed, rebuild needed, and undeterminable states",
    "Rebuild scale is reported as counts, with details and a target file written under .temp/doc-link/query-docs",
    "User chooses between searching after rebuild or searching the existing version",
    "Undeterminable state is a failure; search stops and cause is returned, with no fallback to the old version",
    "Each candidate carries document ID, recorded path, reason, optional sections, ToC key, version, and freshness",
    "query-worker reads the full ToC copy and prefers recall; the copy contains no paths, hashes, or references",
    "Script validates returned IDs, drops only invalid or duplicate ones, and reports them; all-invalid is a failure",
    "resolve-dlid resolves DLIDs from recorded paths by checking the file, returning heading, anchor, and content hash",
    "Missing files or mismatched DLIDs return not-at-recorded-path; unknown DLIDs return no record"
  ],
